OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 30 APR
OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GSoweto presents another hour of
OL,6,     Gbest in jazz, with a focus on
OL,7,     GInternational Jazz Day and this
OL,8,     Gyear's host city of Chicago.
OL,9,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,10,     GGeorgian pianist Elisabeth
OL,11,     GLeonskaja performs Schubert's
OL,12,     GFour Impromptus D.899; joined by
OL,13,     GBudapest-born pianist Mihaly
OL,14,     GBerecz to play a selection of
OL,15,     GBrahms's Hungarian Dances.
